00:27:53,981 --> 00:27:58,980
The job involves bringing down and removing all the structures on the million square foot grounds,

384
00:27:58,981 --> 00:28:06,200
foot grounds, accomplished with MCM's state-of-the-art fleet of customized machines, including its

