00:28:48,060 --> 00:28:49,780
It's not a battle between building and man.

395
00:28:50,200 --> 00:28:51,980
It's not a battle between building and machine.

396
00:28:51,981 --> 00:28:53,360
It's not a battle at all.

397
00:28:53,361 --> 00:29:01,060
There's one structure left to bring down on the Cincinnati site, Building 60, a 10-story steel tower.

